PROJECT: Cardano

## Token Information

Official Token Name: ADA
Symbol: ADA
Token Standard: Native Asset (Cardano Multi-Asset Ledger, CIP-14 Asset Fingerprint) — not ERC-20, not SPL, not BEP-20
Blockchain: Cardano Mainnet
Contract Address: tidak berlaku (native protocol token; Policy ID: native, Asset Name: ada)
Decimals: 6 (1 ADA = 1,000,000 lovelace)
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Native Tokens Docs, https://docs.cardano.org/native-tokens/]; (HIGH) [CIP-14 User-Facing Asset Fingerprint, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip14/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Architecture, https://docs.cardano.org/architecture]

## Supply

Maximum Supply: 45,000,000,000 ADA (hard cap per monetary policy)
Total Supply: ~36,800,000,000 ADA (estimated as of 2024-12; includes circulating + staking rewards reserve + treasury)
Circulating Supply: ~35,600,000,000 ADA (estimated as of 2024-12; excludes treasury reserve and unclaimed rewards)
Initial Supply: ~31,112,484,646 ADA (genesis distribution: voucher holders ~25.9B + founding entities ~5.185B)
Supply Type: Inflationary (monetary expansion for staking rewards and treasury; diminishing emission schedule)
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Monetary Policy, https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-components/cardano-token/monetary-policy/]; (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]; (MEDIUM) [AdaStat Supply Analytics, https://adastat.net/]; (MEDIUM) [Blockfrost Supply API, https://docs.blockfrost.io/#tag/Supply]

## Distribution

Community (Voucher Sale Participants): ~25,900,000,000 ADA (57.6% of initial supply) — sold via Attain Alternative Strategies Ltd 2015-2017
Team (Input Output Global / IOG): ~2,463,071,701 ADA (5.5% of initial supply) — genesis allocation
Investors: tidak ada investor VC/private sale terpisah; distribusi melalui voucher sale publik dan genesis allocation ke entitas pendiri
Foundation (Cardano Foundation): ~648,176,760 ADA (1.4% of initial supply) — genesis allocation
Treasury (On-Chain Protocol Treasury): ~1,300,000,000 ADA (estimated 2024-12; accumulates from fees + monetary expansion) — governed by CIP-1694
Ecosystem (Emurgo): ~2,074,165,623 ADA (4.6% of initial supply) — genesis allocation
Advisors: tidak ada alokasi advisor terpisah terdokumentasi
Other (Staking Rewards Reserve / Monetary Expansion): ~8,887,515,354 ADA (19.8% of initial supply) — reserved for future epoch rewards per monetary policy
Sources: (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Launch and Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]; (HIGH) [Cardano Monetary Policy, https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-components/cardano-token/monetary-policy/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Foundation Annual Report 2018 Genesis Allocation, https://cardanofoundation.org/annual-report-2018/]; (MEDIUM) [AdaStat Genesis Wallets, https://adastat.net/]

