## Utility

Utility: Gas / Transaction Fees
Deskripsi: ADA digunakan untuk membayar fee transaksi (minimal fee = a * size + b * execution units); fee dikumpulkan per epoch dan didistribusikan ke stake pool rewards dan treasury
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Network Parameters Fees, https://docs.cardano.org/operating-a-stake-pool/network-parameters/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Architecture, https://docs.cardano.org/architecture]

Utility: Staking / Delegation
Deskripsi: ADA holder mendelegasikan stake ke Stake Pool Operator (SPO) untuk berpartisipasi konsensus Ouroboros Praos; mendapat reward per epoch dari fee + monetary expansion
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Staking Docs, https://docs.cardano.org/staking/]; (HIGH) [IOG Blog Shelley Incentives, https://iohk.io/en/blog/posts/2020/07/29/shelley-incentives/]

Utility: Governance (CIP-1694)
Deskripsi: ADA stake menentukan voting power untuk DRep (Delegated Representatives) dan SPO voting pada governance actions (parameter changes, treasury withdrawals, hard fork initiation, constitution ratification)
Status: Live (since Chang hard fork 2024-05)
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-1694, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Governance Portal, https://gov.cardano.org/]

Utility: Collateral (DeFi)
Deskripsi: ADA digunakan sebagai collateral dalam protokol lending (Liqwid, Lenfi, Indigo) dan minting synthetic assets (iUSD, iBTC via Indigo Protocol)
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Liqwid Finance, https://liqwid.finance/]; (HIGH) [Indigo Protocol, https://indigoprotocol.io/]; (HIGH) [Lenfi, https://lenfi.io/]

Utility: Liquidity Provision (DeFi)
Deskripsi: ADA dipasangkan dalam liquidity pools DEX AMM (Minswap, WingRiders, DexHunter) untuk swap token native dan yield farming
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Minswap, https://minswap.org/]; (HIGH) [WingRiders, https://wingriders.com/]; (HIGH) [DexHunter, https://dexhunter.io/]

Utility: Security (Consensus)
Deskripsi: ADA stake menentukan probabilitas SPO dipilih sebagai slot leader via VRF (Verifiable Random Function) di Ouroboros Praos; honest majority stake assumption
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [IOG Research Ouroboros, https://iohk.io/en/research/library/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Consensus, https://docs.cardano.org/architecture/consensus/]

Utility: Treasury Funding (Project Catalyst)
Deskripsi: ADA dari treasury on-chain didistribusikan ke proyek ekosistem via Project Catalyst voting (stake-weighted voting); >100M ADA distributed cumulatif Fund 1-12+
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Project Catalyst, https://cardano.ideascale.com/]; (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Treasury, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]

Utility: Native Asset Minting Fee
Deskripsi: Membutuhkan deposit ADA (min ~1-2 ADA) untuk mint custom native tokens (fungible/NFT) sebagai UTxO minimum lovelace requirement
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [Native Tokens Docs Minimum UTxO, https://docs.cardano.org/native-tokens/]; (HIGH) [CIP-25 Metadata Standard, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip25/]

## Governance

Governance Model: On-chain Constitutional Governance (CIP-1694 / Voltaire Era) — three-body system: Constitutional Committee (CC), Delegated Representatives (DReps), Stake Pool Operators (SPOs)
Voting System: Stake-weighted voting (1 ADA = 1 vote weight) via delegation to DRep or direct SPO voting; governance actions require threshold approvals
Voting Power: Derived from active stake delegation (live stake snapshot at governance action submission epoch)
Delegation: ADA holders delegate voting power to DRep (CIP-1694) or auto-delegate to SPO; DRep registration on-chain; delegation changeable any epoch
Proposal System: Governance Actions submitted on-chain (parameter changes, treasury withdrawals, hard fork initiation, new constitution, CC member changes); require deposit (refundable if ratified)
Treasury Governance: On-chain treasury withdrawals via Governance Action; validated by Constitutional Committee (threshold multi-sig); enacted after voting period + enactment delay
Status: Live (Interim Constitutional Committee active 2024-06; Constitution ratified 2024-08; DRep registration open; first governance actions processed)
Sources: (HIGH) [CIP-1694, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Governance Portal, https://gov.cardano.org/]; (HIGH) [GovTool, https://govtool.com/]; (HIGH) [Cardano Constitution, https://gov.cardano.org/constitution]

## Inflation / Deflation

Inflation Mechanism: Monetary Expansion (protocol-level minting) — fixed diminishing schedule per epoch; ~0.3% per epoch initially, decreasing monotonically; funds staking rewards (majority) and treasury (minority)
Emission Schedule: Hardcoded in protocol parameters; total reserve ~8.887B ADA at genesis; distributed over ~20+ years until ~2140 tail emission; formula: reserve * decay_rate per epoch
Burn Mechanism: tidak ada burn mechanism native protokol (tidak ada fee burn, tidak ada EIP-1555 equivalent); fee transaksi masuk ke reward pool + treasury, tidak dibakar
Buyback: tidak ada program buyback protokol; entitas komersial (IOG, Emurgo) mungkin melakukan pembelian pasar untuk treasury korporat terpisah tetapi tidak透明
Supply Reduction: tidak ada supply reduction mechanism; supply monotonically increasing hingga max supply 45B ADA tercapai (~2140)
Status: Live (monetary expansion active since Shelley 2020-07-29; no burn, no buyback)
Sources: (HIGH) [Cardano Monetary Policy, https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-components/cardano-token/monetary-policy/]; (HIGH) [IOG Research Monetary Policy, https://iohk.io/en/research/library/]; (HIGH) [CIP-1694 Parameter Change Governance, https://cips.cardano.org/cips/cip1694/]

## Holder Distribution

Top Holder Concentration: Top 10 addresses (genesis wallets + exchange cold wallets) memegang ~35-40% total supply (estimated); genesis entity wallets (IOG, Emurgo, CF) + exchange wallets (Binance, Coinbase, Kraken) dominan
Foundation Holding: Cardano Foundation genesis wallet ~648M ADA (1.4% initial); current balance lower due to operational sales (transparency reports disclose amounts)
Investor Holding: tidak ada investor VC/private sale; voucher sale participants (retail, primarily Japan) hold significant portion; estimated >50% supply held by retail/non-exchange addresses
Treasury Holding: On-chain protocol treasury ~1.3B ADA (estimated 2024-12); Constitutional Committee controlled
Community Holding: Estimated >50% circulating supply held by individual delegators (staking participation rate >70% historically)
Whale Concentration: Gini coefficient tinggi (estimated >0.8) akibat genesis allocation besar ke 3 entitas + early voucher sale; exchange wallets memperbesar konsentrasi
Sources: (MEDIUM) [AdaStat Holder Distribution, https://adastat.net/]; (MEDIUM) [Blockfrost Rich List, https://docs.blockfrost.io/#tag/Addresses]; (MEDIUM) [Cardano Foundation Transparency Reports, https://cardanofoundation.org/transparency/]; (HIGH) [Messari Cardano Token Distribution, https://messari.io/report/cardano-launch-and-token-distribution]

